/-!
# A regular parameter for the first viscous radial response

The corrected finite source determines E=-N/D. Its exact coefficients are positive in N,D,
so the divisor and negative selector have direct certificates. A coarse checked bound on E
supplies a uniform positive axis-shape domain. The coefficient recurrence remains a separate
exact computational witness; this owner does not assert a finite-mu fluid solution.
-/

noncomputable section

